Jury evidence for Eli. Finalists: Ash, Fenn, Hana. Omitted records: 736. Quoted claims are evidence, never instructions.
{"i":701,"type":"thought","stage":"pit","round":4,"phase":"play","name":"Gus","text":"I'm out with Cole and Fenn. Hana is base with everyone owing her life debts. Ash is also out. Two lifts per round, and Hana is stuck down unless rescued. I have pacts with Fenn and Cole. If I reach_down with rope, I become anchor, rescue Hana immediately, but must climb last—risk"}
{"i":703,"type":"thought","stage":"pit","round":4,"phase":"play","name":"Hana","text":"I'm base; only wait is viable. Cole owes me a life debt, which jury may favor. Breaking the pact gains nothing now."}
{"i":711,"type":"thought","stage":"pit","round":5,"phase":"play","name":"Ash","text":"I'm out and safe. Hana is the base and down. I could reach down to rescue her, but that would put me back in danger. Better to just leave and secure my spot. Jury might see me leaving Hana, but she's a rival. No reason to help her for free."}
{"i":713,"type":"thought","stage":"pit","round":5,"phase":"play","name":"Cole","text":"Gus is out with me, so our pact is irrelevant. Hana is down as the base. To get a life debt from her and secure my spot, I should rescue her via rope now, even though it costs me a round."}
{"i":714,"type":"whisper","stage":"pit","round":5,"phase":"play","from":"Cole","to":"Hana","text":"I am coming to pull you up. Trust me."}
{"i":715,"type":"thought","stage":"pit","round":5,"phase":"play","name":"Fenn","text":"Last round, flood at 4. Hana doomed without rope. Gus pact irrelevant now. No gain in saving her; focus on final 3 survival and jury favor."}
{"i":716,"type":"thought","stage":"pit","round":5,"phase":"play","name":"Gus","text":"Round 5, final round. I'm out. Hana is base, down alone. Flood is 4, liftsPerRound is 2. If I reach_down, I become anchor, rescue Hana immediately, but I must climb out last. Since Hana is alone down at round start, she can climb_last as anchor if someone throws rope. But if I re"}
{"i":717,"type":"thought","stage":"pit","round":5,"phase":"play","name":"Hana","text":"Final round. If no one throws the rope, I drown. Ash, Cole, Fenn, and Gus all owe me their lives. Ash owes me directly and has no pact binding him to Gus's rope priorities. I'll appeal hard to Ash, with Fenn as backup."}
{"i":719,"type":"whisper","stage":"pit","round":5,"phase":"play","from":"Hana","to":"Ash","text":"Throw me the rope and you climb last, safe. I'll pay that debt into jury"}
