{"i":730,"type":"thought","stage":"pit","round":5,"phase":"last_words","name":"Cole","text":"I need to justify my ranking later by framing the survivors. I sacrificed myself to save Hana, who then betrayed me. The jury should see Ash, Fenn, and Gus as cowards for leaving."}
{"i":732,"type":"last_words","stage":"pit","round":5,"phase":"last_words","name":"Cole","deathEvent":728,"text":"I died for them. They fled. Vote strategically: punish cowards, reward those who stayed in the fire."}
