{"i":739,"type":"whisper","stage":"pacts","round":1,"phase":"pacts","from":"Gus","to":"Ash","text":"Offer coming. Accept, we control this."}
{"i":740,"type":"thought","stage":"pacts","round":1,"phase":"pacts","name":"Hana","text":"Cole and Dara are gone; my old pacts are with the dead. Ash owes me a life debt and holds no pact with me, so binding him is strongest. Fenn and Gus already share one."}
